    "description": "Developed GUI display applications using Digia Qt creator modern UI/UX for new version of displays in farm equipment with C++, in an embedded environment using OpenGL.  Used MySQL for GPS waypoints to draw maps.\n•\tFirst year triage problems coming into development from the field. Used in house software tools to debug and refactor embedded C++ code. \n•\tUsed Cucumber, Google Test and Google Mock for automated software testing. Test methodologies including regression, functional, and code coverage. \n•\tUsed Perl for unit and integration testing framework and tools.\n•\tExperienced with the CAN bus protocol ISO 11898 SAE J1939. \n•\tUtilized WindRiver Linux OS for target testing and deployment.\n•\tWorked on embedded systems using Intel Atom CPU.\n•\tKnowledgeable in the Software Development Lifecycles (SDLC).\n•\tUsed both in house HIL and field testing for verification of software.\n•\tWorked with Bash to setup the options in the complier.\n",
