    "description": "Promoted to Software Engineer working with the Commercial System Pro Line Fusion Project. Developed GUI display applications using Presagis VAPS XT, MBD (Model Based Development) using C++, and LynxOS-178 RTOS (Real Time Operating System) Green Hills OS, in an embedded system. Experience with DO-178B, with computer vision.\n•\tUsed Embedded C programming for low level drivers for I/O and GPS chip set.\n•\tUsed ARM assembly language and debugger along with Lauterbach.\n•\tUsed code coverage software LDRA.\t\t\t\t\t\n•\tWorked on the ATE (Automatic Testing Equipment) stations for testing digital and RF units.  Building relationships with factory workers and design Engineers alike, for all service centers worldwide. Worked with outside vendors for incorporating new test equipment into the ATE, such as Tektronix Oscilloscope, Agilent, Rohde & Schwarz, and National Instruments. For replacement of obsolete oscilloscopes, network analyzers. Introduced new technology such as the Physical Ethernet Switch from DowKey Microwave, Fiber Optic switch from Exfo. All using instrumentation and communication busses GPIB, FireWire, RS-232, RS-422, UDP, TCP/IP.\n",
